  "name": "Sausage with Peppers, Onions, and Beer",
  "subtitle": "A hearty skillet meal with tender vegetables and savory sausage",
  "description": "Browned sausage simmers with colorful peppers, onions, herbs, and beer for a substantial one-pan dinner.",
